BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sonny: Documentary Screening
DTSTART:20260927T160000
DTEND:20260927T170000
DTSTAMP:20260927T154133Z
UID:c56aa8dc0d38daa90976752d55b208@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:A touching tribute to a local legend\, Sonny is an intimate do
 cumentary that follows the life of Sonny Brown\, a 93-year-old farmer who 
 has called East Dover home his entire life. Throughout nearly a century of
  change\, Sonny has traded horses for tractors and a crosscut saw for a ch
 ainsaw yet remained deeply rooted in the land and the community that shape
 d him. At its heart\, Sonny celebrates a beloved husband\, father\, grandf
 ather\, and great grandfather whose unwavering work ethic and quiet devoti
 on to others remind us that the greatest legacies are often built through 
 a lifetime of quiet service. A true East Dover story. Mountain Park Cinema
  Artist Group Info Matt Oakes firesidemediacompany@gmail.com https://www.f
 iresidemediacompany.com/ Mountain Park Cinema 4 Mountain Park Plaza West D
 over \, Vermont 05356 https://www.memhall.org/ Submit An Event Find out wh
 at's happening in your neck of the woods with Vermont Public's free Events
  newsletter. Email Address * Editorial Emails Breaking News | sent occasio
 nally The Frequency | Daily News Update\, sent weekday mornings Capitol Re
 cap | Vermont Legislature Wrap\, sent Fridays during the session Brave Lit
 tle State | People-Powered Journalism\, sent every other Saturday But Why 
 | A Podcast For Curious Kids\, sent every other Friday Homegoings | A righ
 teous space for art and race\, sent bi-weekly following an episode drop Ou
 t There | Out There | Your monthly dose of the environment + the great out
 doors\, sent Thursday mor Supporter Emails Membership Renewal Notices | Se
 nt 12 months after your most recent contribution The President's Report | 
 A letter from our president exclusively for members of our Producers Circl
 e The Transmitter | A behind-the-scenes newsletter exclusively for active 
 members\, sent the first Tues But Why Fan Club | Activity Newsletter exclu
 sively for active members of the But Why Fan Club\, sent Other Fundraising
  Emails | Matching challenges\, prize drawings and more\, sent periodicall
 y Audience Emails Program Schedules | Full TV listings for all channels\, 
 sent monthly This Week | Weekly program highlights\, sent each weekend Eve
